{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"元朗村屋圍牆倒塌壓斃女工　承建商工程公司罰款44萬元\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/LABOUR-DEATH-261110-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】元朗一間村屋清拆期間，圍牆倒塌壓斃女工，承建商及兩間工程公司合共罰款44萬元。</p><p>涉事包括承建商、展鋒工程有限公司及鈞威機械工程有限公司，在粉嶺裁判法院分別被判罰款15.5萬元及13萬元。</p><p>事發去年11月5日，元朗一間清拆中村屋女工進行清理工作時，圍牆倒塌將她壓住，送院後證實不治。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.947683+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:08:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:30:37.170894+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:59.100594+00:00","content_hash":"afdafbf009cc0385701ae5a0ce26812576201dc67317588c148c3a72ecb29ed3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.947683+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}